1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,879
Writing, task two. E-mail number 1: Looking for a flat.

2
00:00:05,567 --> 00:00:15,685
You want to move. Write an e-mail to an estate agency. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

3
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:25,467
Hello,

4
00:00:25,767 --> 00:00:27,414
I am looking for a flat to rent.

5
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:30,805
I need a 2+1 flat because I have a wife and a son.

6
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:33,659
We want to live near the centre or near a school.

7
00:00:33,967 --> 00:00:37,270
We can pay at most 18,000 CZK a month.

8
00:00:37,567 --> 00:00:39,827
We want to move from 1 September.

9
00:00:40,133 --> 00:00:43,334
I can come to see the flat on Monday or Wednesday afternoon.

10
00:00:43,633 --> 00:00:44,964
Thank you for your reply.

11
00:00:45,267 --> 00:00:52,708
This e-mail has 52 words. One sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

12
00:00:53,400 --> 00:01:02,411
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
